flowchart LR
 U[User] --> IAM[Identity / session policy]
 IAM --> APP[Agent application]
 DOC[Untrusted RAG content] --> RET[Retrieval / provenance]
 RET --> APP
 APP --> LLM[LLM reasoning]
 LLM --> REQ[Proposed tool action]
 REQ --> AUTH{Independent authorization}
 AUTH -->|Denied| AUD[Audit / notify]
 AUTH -->|Approved| TOOL[Scoped tool execution]
 TOOL --> AUD
 AUD --> OBS[Monitoring and evaluation]
